<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>20-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 5 minutes. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C2C-M01"><h3>Question 1 · Preparing for an overnight visitor</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">姑妈今晚住我们家，客房还没整理。</p><p class="cn">你去车站接她吧，房间我来收拾。水果弟弟已经买好了。</p><p class="cn">好，我现在去车站。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M02"><h3>Question 2 · Dinner after a train journey</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">舅舅的火车六点到站，是不是六点就吃晚饭？</p><p class="cn">不行，从车站到家还要四十分钟。我们七点开饭，先让他把行李放好。</p><p class="cn">好，七点一起吃。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M03"><h3>Question 3 · A regular family meal</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们平时各自在家吃饭，每个月的第一个和第三个星期日，才去奶奶家一起吃。我每个月去两次，不是每个星期都去，也不是每天去。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M04"><h3>Question 4 · Choosing a place to ride</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我周日下午有空，想骑一段平路，不想上坡。</p><p class="cn">山边的路一直能骑，可是有坡；学校里的平路周日不开。河边的平路下午开放。</p><p class="cn">那就去河边。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M05"><h3>Question 5 · A different approach to cycling</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">小林以前骑车总要和朋友比快。昨天他没有看用时，慢慢骑了一圈，还停下拍了几张照片。回家以后他说，这次比以前轻松，以后还想这样骑。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M06"><h3>Question 6 · A market meeting point</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们在老菜市场门口见吗？</p><p class="cn">今天要去的是社区新市场，在邮局旁边。老菜市场已经关了，别去错。</p><p class="cn">明白，我在新市场东门等你。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M07"><h3>Question 7 · Walking instead of waiting</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">公交车去市场要绕路，得坐半个小时。</p><p class="cn">从这里走过去只要十分钟，我今天也没带自行车。</p><p class="cn">那我们走路去，买好东西再看怎么回来。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M08"><h3>Question 8 · A detour beside the river</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">市场南门前修路，从车站出来怎么走？</p><p class="cn">先沿河向北走，到了小桥再过河。过桥后就是市场北门，不要从南门硬走过去。</p><p class="cn">好，先往北。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M09"><h3>Question 9 · Transport with the right payment method</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">去市场的班车九点四十到，只收现金。公交车九点五十到，可以刷交通卡。</p><p class="cn">我十点前要到，身上只有交通卡，没有现金，坐公交吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M10"><h3>Question 10 · Changing a windy-day activity</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">周日风太大，带客人去放风筝的事怎么办？</p><p class="cn">先在家教大家做纸风筝吧，做好留着，下星期天气合适再出去放。</p><p class="cn">好，周日就在家做。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M11"><h3>Question 11 · Packing gifts by household</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">姑妈和叔叔两家都来，每个人都送一盒饼干吗？</p><p class="cn">不用按人数送，每家一盒，一共两盒。茶叶另外带一袋，留在家里大家一起喝。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M12"><h3>Question 12 · A cup with the right features</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这三种杯子，你想送哪一种给叔叔？</p><p class="cn">叔叔喜欢小杯子，而且一定要有把手。这只小号带把手的就合适，大号和没把手的都不要。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M13"><h3>Question 13 · A packaged gift price</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">茶叶一小袋六块，三袋散着买十八块。装成这套礼盒要二十五块，盒子和包装都算在里面。</p><p class="cn">我要这套包好的礼盒，送给客人。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M14"><h3>Question 14 · A gift for a train journey</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">客人明天坐火车走，想带一件轻又不容易碎的礼物。</p><p class="cn">玻璃杯不合适，大花瓶也重。围巾很轻，折起来就能放进包里，不用担心打碎。</p><p class="cn">那选围巾。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M15"><h3>Question 15 · Getting the seating ready</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">客人六点来，你几点能到家？</p><p class="cn">我六点才到，来不及准备。</p><p class="cn">我五点就到。那我先把客厅椅子摆好，你回来陪客人聊天，晚饭弟弟已经订了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M16"><h3>Question 16 · Wind in the afternoon</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">早上外面几乎没有风，可是预报说下午风会大很多，晚上也不会马上停。今天气温变化不大，想骑车的同学要注意下午的风，别只看早上的天气。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M17"><h3>Question 17 · Moving paper activities</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天为什么把写贺卡的桌子搬进屋？外面也没有下雨啊。</p><p class="cn">风太大，纸一直被吹走。我们在屋里写完，再拿出去给客人看，时间还是三点。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M18"><h3>Question 18 · Water before a bicycle outing</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天骑车在广场集合，那里能装水吗？</p><p class="cn">没有饮用水，来以前要在家装好一瓶。路上商店也没开，别到了广场才找水。</p><p class="cn">好，我出门前装好。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M19"><h3>Question 19 · A family festival evening</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">去年中秋，我们先给住在外地的姐姐打电话。吃完晚饭，全家一起分月饼。后来月亮出来了，才到阳台拍照。姐姐看了照片，说好像也和我们坐在一起。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2C-M20"><h3>Question 20 · Together despite the distance</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">哥哥出差不能回来，奶奶起初说今年中秋少了一个人。后来我们接通视频，哥哥也在屏幕那边吃饭。奶奶一直笑，还请我们把手机放近一点儿，好让她看清哥哥。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">家里明天有客人来，我们还需要买什么？请说一种东西，也可以说已经准备好了。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">招待客人，你想选水果还是点心？也可以选别的东西。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">这个选择有什么好处？给我说一个和客人有关的理由吧。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">市场今天四点就关门，原来五点去来不及了。你准备怎么调整？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>